'''Jango Fett's apartment'''<ref name="Complete Locations">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> was an apartment in [[Kamino]]'s [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Tipoca City]]. It was owned by the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Jango Fett]], who lived there with his [[Cloning|cloned]] son, [[Boba Fett]], while serving as the [[clone template]] of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] until they were forced to flee to [[Geonosis]] due to the arrival of [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]].<ref name="Episode II" />

